flowchart TD
  A[Customer app or website] --> B[Browse provider + plan]
  B --> C[Server-calculated checkout]
  C --> D[Payment gateway]
  D --> E{Verified by server?}
  E -- No --> F[Pending/failed; no entitlement]
  E -- Yes --> G[Activate subscription or paid meal]
  G --> H{Pickup or delivery?}
  H -- Pickup --> I[Short-lived QR]
  I --> J[Provider scan endpoint]
  J --> K[Atomic one-time redemption]
  H -- Delivery --> L[Delivery assignment]
  L --> M[Rider pickup]
  M --> N[OTP/QR drop-off verification]
  N --> O[Atomic delivery completion + redemption]
  K --> P[History + ledger + provider view]
  O --> P
